WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:02.043
Tell me what you're doing
at NASA.

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:05.046
Not much.

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:08.925
I'm going to PR events
as the token black girl.

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:13.888
And that's it?
Mm-hmm.

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:15.640
After everything you did
to earn that pin,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:16.850
and that's all they give you?

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.560
Yeah.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.271
Well, there is one other thing
they want me to do.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:22.731
What?

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.608
Fly to the moon.

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.737
Wait. Are you saying that...

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:32.490
Yes! I have been
assigned to Apollo 18!
Oh!

00:01:08.443 --> 00:01:12.363
Where did people come from
in the beginning?

00:01:12.363 --> 00:01:17.327
Most of them say that humans originally
inhabited a single planetary system.

00:01:17.327 --> 00:01:21.998
And we don't even know which.
Sirius, Alpha Centauri…

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:24.834
Some people think that we came
from some place called Earth.

